# Accidental duplicate/backup files (often created by copy operations)
**/*.backup
**/Podfile 2
**/Generated 2.xcconfig
**/flutter_export_environment 2.sh
**/gradlew 2
**/gradlew 2.bat
**/gradle-wrapper 2.jar

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Android build reports/output (auto-generated on every build)
/android/build/
/android/app/build/

# Environment variables
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Generated local config
/lib/core/config/ad_config.g.dart

# Android release signing
/android/key.properties
/android/upload-keystore.jks

# Release artifacts
/releases/*.aab

# Firebase config (contains API keys — do not commit if repo is public)
android/app/google-services.json

# 플랫폼 자동 생성 파일 (해당 플랫폼 안 쓰는 경우, 빌드 때마다 재생성됨)
linux/flutter/generated_plugin_registrant.cc
linux/flutter/generated_plugins.cmake
macos/Flutter/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.swift
